  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program in Support of Subsidies for Innovation in Agricultural Technology</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyos a la Innovacin Tecnolgica Agropecuaria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del proyecto es contribuir a mejorar la productividad del sector agropecuario, brindando apoyos directos a pequeos productores para cubrir parcialmente los costos de implementacin de nuevas tecnologas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects objective is to contribute to improve agricultural sectors productivity, through direct supports to small farmers in order to partly cover the implementation costs of new technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
